undred and eighty seven  thousand dollars  after his vegas trip he went back to  university more determined than ever he  resumed his studies while continuing to  hone his poker skills in cash games  after classes some weeks he claimed he  was making ninety thousand dollars he  was making so much money from playing  poker he realized that university was a  waste of time so he dropped out of  university and decided to become a  professional poker player  he claimed to have built his wealth from  playing poker but he hasn't appeared in  a lot of public tournaments his first  major appearance was back in 2009 when  he took part in the world series of  poker main event dan finished 180th  place and collected a prize of 36 000  his performance led to him signing a  sponsorship with victory poker an online  card room he allegedly received one  million dollars from the company for  wearing their name on a t-shirt for all  the tournaments he competed in that year  but despite his efforts victory poker  crumbled just after his one-year  contract with him had ended  dan apparently dedicated most of his  time and focus to private high-stakes  cash games with billionaires he has also  once claimed to have put all of his net  worth into one game and won big in 2013  he got people's attention when he posted  a tweet saying he had just won 10.8  million dollars in a private cash game  this win still hasn't been verified and  continues to be debated by many online  in 2015 dan hosted a poker tournament to  raise money for brain research the  tournament took place in his las vegas  home and had a buy-in of a thousand  dollars the tournament drew in a lot of  famous celebrities like steve aoki  ludacris and vin diesel and raised over  a hundred thousand dollars for brain  research according to dan himself the  most he has ever lost in a single game  of poker was 3.6 million dollars there  were also stories about dan betting 2.3  million dollars worth of chips on a  single coin toss and losing  dan's net worth is estimated to be  around a staggering 200 million dollars  and according to himself 50 million  dollars of that is from playing poker  he's most known for his insane lifestyle  models supercars private jets rpgs and  lavish parties the crazy stories just  keep coming his instagram has more  models than playboy and victoria's  secrets put together and that seems to  be the biggest reason for his fame  he apparently had a heart attack for  overdosing on viagra dan has admitted  that he had his first two heart attacks  at the age of 25 and had a total of  three heart attacks before the age of  32.  apparently after four days of binge  drinking and doing drugs dan ingested  about six times the recommended dose of  viagra to get things going downstairs  which resulted in a heart attack  he also bought his way into the armenian  army for a citizenship  upon joining the army dan celebrated the  feat by launching a bazooka he was once  also arrested by the los angeles police  department for a bomb making charge but  charges were later dropped  he has also been put on the  international wanted list by a court in  azerbaijan in early 2015 dan announced  that he would be running for president  he also vowed to give up sex drugs and  alcohol if he was elected  eventually he bound out of the race to  endorse donald trump who eventually went  on to win the presidency  in april 2014 dan was part of a photo  shoot that included the then 18 year old  porn star janice griffith  as part of the photo shoot he picked up  janice griffith and threw her off the  roof aiming for the pool beneath but his  throw was just a bit too short and she  hit the edge of the pool before falling  in the water griffith broke her foot and  the whole thing ended in a lawsuit in  december 2014 dan attended a nightclub  in miami to celebrate his 34th birthday  and for a yet undisclosed reason dan  decided to kick one of the women in the  face with his military boot he was also  i